WEBVTT

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.280
Yamamoto-kun,
I read your letter.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.250
You wanted to talk to me?

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.810
Um... w-well,

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:54.920
S-Sakurada-san, I-I...

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.750
I'm sorry!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.880
To be honest,
after lacrosse today...

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:06.570
I'm supposed to have cake
with everyone at home.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:11.270
I need to hurry home, so can we
have this talk another time?

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:13.040
Um, uh...

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.500
I'm really sorry.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:16.540
See you.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:29.340
Well, I better get going.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.860
Stairs

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.870
Everyone, it's all ready!

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.870
Come eat!

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:43.740
Quiet.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.810
Captain, talk later.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:48.240
We're at a very crucial scene now.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.470
She'll be in danger if we don't hurry!

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:49.240
What?

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:51.740
Oh, this is terrible!

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.740
Yet another body!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:57.000
Kun-kun, what is with this case?

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.830
Please calm down, Captain!

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.990
Let us start over again!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.800
This should be easy if we
look at the crime scene.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:05.730
Kun-kun is a genius.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.490
Sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.730
You can do it!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.730
Kun-kun,
Hina is with you!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.470
Kun-kun, what is that?

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:18.700
Here you are, Hina-chan.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.660
And one for you too.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.170
Thank you.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.280
Strawberries! Cake!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.210
It looks delicious!

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.450
Thanks for the food!

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.920
Hold it right there!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.760
What is it, Kun-kun?

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.040
You mustn't move that body!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.420
Take a good look at the victim's neck!

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.430
These marks!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.930
Wrapped around and bound up!

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.430
Wrapped and bound...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.300
This puppet show is
surprisingly hard-core.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.300
This is a clever trick
using wakame seaweed!

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.440
The mystery is completely solved!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.810
The culprit is...

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.030
Shut up!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.040
Oh, Hina-chan, what's wrong?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.560
Hina's strawberry...

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:20.560
The cake...

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.800
Hina-Ichigo, you're so terrible.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:27.260
She ate her own strawberry

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.310
and is now acting up,
demanding my strawberry too.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.310
My...

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:36.210
Hina-chan, that's wrong.
You ate yours, right?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.310
What?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.590
N-No... Not...

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.320
Oh, fine then.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.830
If you're going to be that way...

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.210
I'll give my precious strawberry
to this gluttonous brat.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.160
Here!
Take it!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.870
There, there, it's all right.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.180
That won't do Hina-chan any good.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:08.860
Stupid!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:09.740
Hina-chan!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.750
Hina-chan...

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.130
See you again for the
resolution next weekun-kun!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.880
Hina-chan, come down!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.250
Let's have cake together!

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.640
Oh, dear.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.600
She's in such a sulk
she won't come down.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.910
Maybe I was a little too harsh.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.780
Kun-kun
eats it too!

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.840
Kun-kun dog food!

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.140
Hey, Jun...

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.520
The mystery
is completely solved!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.520
Would you check on Hina?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.680
Why me?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.620
I have to go shopping for
dinner ingredients now.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:59.160
It just means one less.
It's perfect.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.360
Forget her.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.000
You say some good things
once in a while, human.

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:09.120
If we let her be, she'll return to
civilization once she gets hungry.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.140
Exactly.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.970
No!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.360
That's no good!

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.410
We're going to
have a nice dinner together!

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.910
That's easier said...

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.780
If Hina's still an outcast when
I come back from shopping...

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:29.140
I'll cancel tonight's dinner of
flower-topped hamburger steaks!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.930
Shocked

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:36.550
Flower-topped?

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.670
See you later.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.170
We must capture her immediately!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.410
Hey, that shows no
intention of making nice!

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:57.200
If we drag her from the second floor
and put the screws to her, it'll work out.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.150
Your whole argument is flawed!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.390
Then do something about this, Jun.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:09.360
Sheesh, why do I have to do this?

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.100
Hey, chibi Ichigo...

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.110
Hey!

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.830
<i>She's totally sulking for real.</i>

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:30.120
If you're going to mope in bed,
do it in your own case!

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.640
Hey, let go!

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.220
Ow...

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:39.490
What the...?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.490
A-A barricade?

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.860
Hey, come on.
How long will you sulk?

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:48.560
Bad!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.300
This is Hina's territory!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.010
Bad, bad, bad!

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:55.450
Wait, this is my room!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.040
Hey, don't throw minicars!

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:01.540
Hina didn't do anything
wrong, so this is a strike.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.050
Strike?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.420
Whose side are you on?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.970
Hina? Or Suiseiseki?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.790
Which?

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.830
That's easy for you to say.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.190
I didn't see it happen, so I can't...

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.260
You're my enemy too! Go away!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.650
H-Hold on!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:21.840
I didn't see it...

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:24.800
...but considering her past behavior...

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:29.140
She might be capable of that.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.900
Jun, you can come one
step into my territory.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:38.780
Oh, really.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.020
That chibi human is taking his time.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.260
I swear.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.980
That creature is no good,
no matter the task.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.420
T-This is...

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:58.890
This is now Hina and Jun's territory!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.400
How did it come to this?

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:02.810
You all can't come up here!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.510
He seems won over.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.170
Damn you, chibi human!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.520
You turned traitor?

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.610
Shameless bastard!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.010
Sneak!
Four-eyed brat!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.720
Why should I take that?

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.880
That hurt!

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:17.520
How about this?

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.960
Don't you care
what happens to this?

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.750
My case!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.000
Do it.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.340
Roger that!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:27.490
Draw, draw, draw.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.120
It's done!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.670
What are you doing?

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.730
Stop that!

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:42.370
Banzai!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.770
Don't underestimate humans!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.970
I wonder if everyone is getting along.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.840
They'll be fine, right?

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.680
To think the puny runt
converted the runt.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.300
It was beyond my calculations.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.740
But since it's come to
this, it's all-out war.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:19.910
I'll show you well what happens
when you make me angry.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:30.360
We may have to give up on
the flower-topped hamburger steaks.

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.010
Puny Ichigo!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.350
Stupid Ichigo!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.000
No good Ichigo!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.400
Hina did nothing wrong!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.510
You ate the strawberry!

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.500
You meanie! You meanie!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.680
How childish.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:59.040
This all started with you
eating her strawberry, right?

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.370
Apologize!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.920
That's right! That's right!

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.120
You're so mean.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:11.510
What proof do you have
that I ate the strawberry?

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:14.130
I'm being framed!
It's too much!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.410
No! You're lying, Suiseiseki!

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.800
That little...

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:27.500
The two of them are picking on me
because I'm the newcomer!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.450
Everyone is so juvenile.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:43.560
This is the Alligator of Truth,
and it chews up the hands of liars.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:47.790
If what you're saying is true...

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.060
you'll be fine with sticking your hand
in its mouth, right?

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:55.810
How mean! What's he
trying to make me do?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:56.840
I see.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.230
What a brilliant idea.

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.640
Now, put your hand in there.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.030
N-N-N-N-No thank you.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.310
T-T-T-There's no need.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.650
What I'm saying is the truth!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:15.590
Then you can prove it
using this alligator.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:17.160
Now, hurry up.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.760
Please, not you too.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:20.910
Do it now!

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:21.900
Shut up!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.660
Now, hurry up.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:31.560
S-Sorry, sorry!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.870
It was on a lark!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:36.390
She looked so dumb
that I wanted to pick on her!

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:37.830
I meant no harm!

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.810
So please
do something about the alligator!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.200
Huh?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.050
How unseemly.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.720
I can't believe you'd
use that cheap tactic.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:51.060
As I thought, humans are the worst!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.790
She's defiant.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:56.290
At any rate, I'll never
acknowledge this!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.500
I'll never forgive you!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.530
Never, ever till you properly apologize!

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.040
So there!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.540
You know...

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.090
I don't care either way.

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.680
Resolve this soon.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:11.680
I'm getting hungry.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.540
You could help a bit.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.310
No thank you.
It's too much trouble.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.090
You're all so...

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:22.050
3 for 148 yen

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.430
Onion-san,

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:22.050
Carrot-san,

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.000
Potato-san,

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.460
and... and...

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:32.930
And... and Strawberry-san.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.930
It's gotten quiet.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:38.420
Why don't you
make up with her soon?

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.700
No way.

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:42.940
I'll never forgive Suiseiseki
till she apologizes.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:43.940
Is that so?

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.050
C-Caltrops?

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:55.500
Caltrops are tasty!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.950
Hey, why're you eating them?

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.960
Oh, they're Mapollo chocolates.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.960
Attention, rebel forces!
Attention, rebel forces!

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:09.020
We've occupied the kitchen
and the refrigerator!

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:12.470
If you want snacks or anything,
surrender quietly!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:15.590
That little...
She went and got our food!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.600
Well, Shinku?

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:24.530
With this starvation tactic,
it's a matter of time.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:25.980
A sweet strategy.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:28.950
This color, this luster, this aroma...

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.990
It's so irresistible!

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.990
I'm going to enjoy it!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.180
What bliss!

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:41.830
To think I can have all I want
of such delicious sweets.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.030
You think we'll fall for a...

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.630
Candy!

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.350
Hey, don't fall for it already!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.700
Candy!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.840
Why are dolls so big on food?

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.800
Oh, so delicious.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:04.790
Well, if you kneel, apologize,
and swear lifelong loyalty...

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.630
I might be willing to share a little.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.790
Maybe or maybe not.

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:16.100
That cocky, demonic doll refuses
to acknowledge her misdeeds...

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.400
All right, Ichigo, plug your ears!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.830
Quit eating!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.630
T-This sound...

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:28.260
This sound...

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.350
Shinku, doesn't it bother you?

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:35.640
Styrofoam?

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:36.720
What mere child's play.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.250
How do you like that?

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.030
I bet even you can't stand this!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:53.280
Human, I hope you're prepared.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:58.030
Fight sound with sound!

00:15:58.030 --> 00:15:59.510
Take this!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.870
I'm not losing!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.180
No! So noisy!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.510
Bang, bang, bang, bang, bang!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.030
I bought a lot.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.080
Wait for me, everyone.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.190
I'll make delicious hamburger steaks.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.490
Oh, s-sorry!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:00.500
A-Are you okay?

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.980
Y-Yes, I'm fine.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.860
I'm really sorry!

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.810
Oh, it's okay.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.390
Were you watering flowers?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:15.670
I've been watering them a lot,
but only one's flowered.

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:16.450
Oh, dear.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:19.050
Too much water isn't good either.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.910
The seeds will go bad.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:23.190
What? Oh no!

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:28.310
I know!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.760
Wait a bit.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:43.600
I-I'm tired...

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:47.010
Both physically and mentally.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:51.380
It's going bang-bang,
screech-screech in my head.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:55.520
Oh, I'm so hungry.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.200
I'll eat lots of delicious snacks.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.760
Truly a sweet strategy.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.980
Jun, I'm hungry.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.000
It's growling.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.760
H-Hey, Ichigo!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.620
That's right.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.100
She didn't eat her cake.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.000
A prolonged conflict
will be disadvantageous.

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:18.110
Since it's come to this...

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.010
Thanks for waiting!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.830
Flower seeds.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.410
I bought a whole lot.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.750
Let's plant them together.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:35.660
After all, even flowers are happier
when they have lots of friends.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:39.390
I'll plant these, so take those.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.430
Okay.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.240
Let's make lots of flowers.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.270
It's gotten terribly quiet.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:51.980
They should be waving
the white flag soon.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.510
I hope so.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.510
Hey, you guys, take a look at this!

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.500
What's this about?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.580
Kun-kun...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.520
All right, she's taken the bait.

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:16.830
Hi, Shinku. Thanks for always
being supportive of me.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.300
I'm so happy.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.420
I-It's nothing.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.200
M-My pleasure.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.300
What?

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:28.810
But it makes me a little sad
to see you over on that side.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.510
Hold on!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.040
Snap out of it!

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.070
To think one so wise and intelligent

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:39.050
would side with a villain,
unable to see the truth...

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.050
You disappoint me, Shinku.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:44.310
No...

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.760
What is this, chibi human?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.030
If you try anything else, I'll...

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:55.640
No, Kun-kun!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.230
No, listen to me!

00:19:57.230 --> 00:20:01.110
It was all...
It was all her doing!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.140
Shinku... Shinku...

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.010
I... I was against it!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:09.210
Hold on!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:11.620
How dare you pretend to be innocent?

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:15.150
All right, just a little more.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.390
Shinku, help!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:20.890
Kun-kun!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.250
The evil that has possessed
you is hurting me.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.380
Help me!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.620
Hurry to this side!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.630
Kun-kun!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:35.140
Help me... Help me...

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:36.650
Let go!

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:38.510
Kun-kun is... Kun-kun is...

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.230
Wait! I'm coming!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.040
Shinku, no!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.150
This is a trap!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:44.880
Gotcha!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.520
Kun-kun, watch out!

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.260
Y-You went for it?

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.670
Look at the time.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:14.680
Everyone must be hungry.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:17.100
I'm home, everyone!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.580
Were you able to get along...

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.560
H-Hey!

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:38.670
Here you are.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.810
Since you got along...

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:44.160
here are your flower-topped
hamburger steaks, as promised.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:49.090
She's the scariest when
she gets angry for real.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.180
She's the true boss monkey.

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:53.910
You're not to be underestimated, Nori.

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:56.920
I'm starving!

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:58.470
And now...

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.920
Thanks for the food!

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:04.440
Thanks for the food.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:07.720
Now, let's eat.

00:23:42.220 --> 00:23:43.880
Have you seen Hina?

00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:44.670
No.

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:46.520
It's strawberry rice cakes today.

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.570
Where'd she go?

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:49.080
You're worried?

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.030
L-Leftovers are wasteful!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.500
You're not honest.

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:54.140
Oh? What do you have there?

00:23:54.140 --> 00:23:55.720
It was on the floor.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:58.240
What's this doing in the house?

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.450
A black feather...
Could it be...

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:01.470
Shinku?

00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:03.610
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:03.610 --> 00:24:06.460
Swear upon this rose ring.

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:10.980
Chapter 6
Tears
